WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.160
Yuko... listen, Yuko.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.120
Can you hear me?

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.290
My cute little descendant.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.200
This is the second time I've connected with you.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.620
Do you remember me?

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.410
Oh... I actually do remember this feeling.

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:28.330
It was uh, um... uh... um...

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.200
Ah, perhaps you have forgotten.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.950
No, I remember! It's right here,
on the tip of my stomach!

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.080
In other words, it's already been digested.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.330
Uh, I'm too sleepy...

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:42.120
Hold it right there! Don't you dare fall asleep,
you sorry excuse for an heir!

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:47.200
This is the tale of a girl
who received demonic powers overnight,

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:51.080
and must rise up to defeat a Magical Girl
in order to save her family from the grips of poverty.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:53.000
Or something to that effect.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.620
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.040
Nightmare or Forebear?!
The Doorstop of Darkness Descends

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:31.450
I am your great ancestor! The founder of the Dark Clan!

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:29.750
Hiss!

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:34.290
We met once before, on the day you grew
that tail and those horns!

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:35.790
My ancestor...?

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:38.250
That doesn't make sense, you're blonde.

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:41.000
The history of our clan is long and complicated!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.500
We've thrived for thousands of years
through many different lands,

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.950
of course your appearance would change!

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:46.370
Thousands of years?! That's amazing!

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:48.830
Um, can I ask you a question?

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.330
Anything you wish!

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:53.830
In all those years and different lands,
did you ever actually win a fight with the Light Clan?

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:58.500
It took me half a day to get all these
shiny decorations put up, what do you think?

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.500
I take it that means success
is a foreign concept to you, too.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:06.120
So, I've been wondering... am I still dreaming right now?

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:09.950
To be precise, I'm actually intruding
within the deepest part of your consciousness.

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:13.870
But you can just think of it as a dream.
It's easier to understand that way.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:18.040
So why did you come all the way
into my dreams, Ms. Ancestor?

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:22.120
Let me explain. This might take a while,
so feel free to take a seat.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:26.370
Newly Remodeled

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:26.370
I've seen these tables and chairs somewhere before!

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:34.540
Newly Remodeled

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:27.910
And this sign, too!

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:31.290
I pulled them out from among
your most recent memories.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.500
If you've got any complaints,
then you only have only yourself to blame.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.540
Is this thing real?

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:38.330
Ever since your powers awakened
and you became active as a Demon Girl,

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:40.200
I've watched your progress
through the Demon God Statue.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:40.870
S
N
A
R
L

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.120
Deep Inner
Tama Station

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:44.250
ONE
HIT
KILL
$35.00
(3,500 YEN)

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:47.080
As a judge, I would give you 5 points!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.700
Huh? Are you sure it's okay to grade me that high?!

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:52.370
WHOAAAAAA

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.370
That's 5 out of 100!

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:53.790
Don't look so happy about it!

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.000
What kind of scoring system did you think I was using?!

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:57.700
A soccer game...

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.250
You dimwit!

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:05.080
Huh? Why am I sitting here in this weird space
surrounded by food court tables

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:08.290
while getting lectured by some half-naked lady?

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:09.250
Ah!

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:12.750
This must be a dream! It's one of those surreal ones!

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.450
I just finished explaining that!

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:16.370
I'm heading out.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.370
Are you going to the library again?

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:22.040
Yeah. I'm going to study hard so I can become
a great tactician who can support Sis.

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:24.700
Don't worry about that, just do your best.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.160
I will.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.040
Is Yuko still up there sleeping like a baby?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:36.120
I have a lot of bones to pick with you,
but the biggest problem is your complete lack of talent!

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:36.830
SHAME

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:36.950
Shame.
Huh?!

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:39.830
It's hard for me to even know where to start!
Your heart is just so damn fragile!

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:40.450
Shame.
Yes, ma'am...

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:40.450
SHAME

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:41.160
Don't start crying!

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:42.910
You have terrible intuition!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:43.200
SHAME

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:44.910
Shame. Shame.
Build some stamina for God's sake! Eat more!

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:44.250
SHAME

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:46.120
Don't give up so quickly!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.040
Shame. Shame.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:46.120
SHAME

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.040
Yes, ma'am...

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:46.790
SHAME

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:52.120
I'm thirsty. I'll take something to drink
from within the depths of your consciousness.

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.540
Oh, please help yourself.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:04.160
Burp... Burp... Burp...!

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.950
Burp... Burp...!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.790
Burp...

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.540
What the hell is this?! Poison?!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.080
It's a carbonated beverage.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:20.620
Well, anyway... this is the first time
that you and I have been properly connected.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.200
Huh?

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:26.830
Our clan has the ability to dive into
other people's dreams and manipulate them freely.

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:31.120
COLA

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.160
Dive into dreams?!

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:29.830
Th-that's amazing!

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:34.250
I'm really... starting to think
that you're super cool, Ms. Ancestor!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.290
Wonderful, feel free to sing my praises
as much as you want!

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:42.660
Have you ever been able to use that power
to win against our enemies?!

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.790
You know, after drinking this weird stuff
I get the feeling it's pretty addictive.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.040
It does that.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.000
Since the Light Clan's seal has started to fade from age,

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:59.660
reaching out to the consciousness of my descendants
should be a trivial task for me.

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:02.620
But for some reason connecting with you
was a HUGE pain in the ass!

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:04.370
Your soul is too weak to pick up
on my sensor! It's pathetic!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:04.950
Huh?!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:13.660
Yuko Sensor

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:07.580
In terms of your modern-day wireless signals,
it's absolutely horrid!

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:11.120
Even at its best, I can only get one bar!
Did you put your heart into airplane mode or what?!

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:13.660
Wow, you really know a lot
about our technology, Ms. Ancestor!

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:20.700
YUKOTENNA MK. I

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.330
You need to make a bedside antenna

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.330
so that my signal can reach!

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.830
If I leave something like that lying around,

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:20.700
my mom is gonna be worried!

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:24.160
Yuko? It's already past noon, are you not getting up?

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.040
That's my mom's voice.

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:27.750
Ah, yes, Seiko.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.660
Do you know my mom?

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:34.200
There's still... more for us to talk about... lots more...

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.200
Oh no, the signal is...

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.120
My ancestor is slowly starting to disappear!

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:41.160
Mom...

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.790
Just one more hour...

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:49.330
My body on the outside still wants to sleep, I guess!
We can keep talking!

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:51.330
That's kind of pitiful, but good job!

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.830
Yuko, are you really not going to get up?

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:58.290
We don't have much time left,
so I'll cut straight to the chase!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:02.040
When you eventually wake up from this dream,
your memory will be mostly unstable.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.750
So when you get up, write all of this down ASAP!

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:04.330
Roger that!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:08.870
Even though I'm still sealed away, I can enjoy
anything that you offer to the Ancestor Statue.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:10.830
So leave some delicious treats
and magazines as offerings!

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:15.290
Also, I don't care how perfect the size is,
stop using it to cover your cup noodles while they cook!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:15.450
When I'm sealed away
Leave offerings
To the Ancestor Statue
Things I can enjoy
Prepare delicious treats
And magazines!
But even though
It's the perfect size
Don't use it
To cover the Cup Noodles
While they cook!

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:16.290
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:22.750
I can tell you more about your father, about your
hidden power and about the device in the statue, but...

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:26.120
Yuko? Today's breakfast is pancakes, you know.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:28.250
If you don't hurry and wake up,
they'll be all cold and soggy.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:30.200
Um, Ms. Ancestor?

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:38.120
SMILE!!

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:35.580
The power of pancakes
is not to be trifled with! Get going!

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:38.120
Remember, the pride and hopes
of our clan rest with you!

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:42.040
Ah... you truly are my ancestor!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:52.080
When you eventually wake up from this dream,
your memory will be mostly unstable.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.790
So when you get up, write all of this down ASAP!

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:57.660
Mom, I need a notebook!
Where's there a notebook?! I'm going to forget!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.330
I saw one next to the phone.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.000
I'm gonna write it all down!

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.580
Before I forget!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:06.580
Are you writing something? Could you
write down a few things for me while you're at it?

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:05.450
Squeeze

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:08.410
My hands are wet, so I can't do it myself.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:11.160
Huh? But I have to record these memories...!

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:15.700
Sugar, paper towels, seaweed, sweet rice wine,

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:19.540
bean sprouts, chicken breasts, green onions, carrots,

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:23.500
alcohol on sale for $1.78 and eggs on sale
for $0.88 starting at 3 pm.

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:25.410
Crap... I forgot....

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:27.500
Sugar, Paper Towels
Green Onions, Carrots
Onions
Chicken
Eggs on sale Wednesday at 10am for $1.78
I was woken up by an ancestor
or something in my dream-

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:30.330
I know whatever happened in that dream
was really important, too!

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:33.830
What's wrong? Your pancakes are going
to get cold if you keep waiting.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.830
Oh, that's right! The pancakes! That's why I woke up!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.750
Time to dig in!

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:45.500
Chew, chew... Chew, chew...

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.290
UMM...

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:49.330
Are these really pancakes...?

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:52.580
They don't taste bad or anything,
but they're really spongey.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.120
I made them from leftover rice and tofu!

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:02.200
I know that dream I had was super important.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:03.370
What's wrong?!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.370
I should have just stayed in bed.

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:06.830
Chew, chew...

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:09.250
Sakuragaoka Library

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.370
I see.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:14.790
Don't want to be caught off guard.

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.700
Mom, are you doing laundry?

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:22.040
That's my one and only uniform for school.
I'll do it myself.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:25.160
It's rare that you want to help. Well, go ahead.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.000
This is my first step to maturing into a great demon!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.000
This is that cola stain from the other day.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:34.000
Burp, burp, burp...!

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:39.000
Oh, that made me remember,
I met with an ancestor person in my dream!

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:39.790
Huh?

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:42.580
I vaguely remember that whoever they were,
they seemed to know you, Mom.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.000
Did they ask you anything?

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:46.500
No, they mostly just got mad at me for stuff.

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:49.910
There was cola and chairs from the food court

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:49.500
Scrub
Scrub
Scrub

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.700
and the whole thing felt really surreal...

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.950
I wonder if it really was only a dream?

00:09:53.500 --> 00:10:01.620
Scrub
Scrub
Scrub

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:57.620
Maybe it was one of those dreams that wasn't a dream?!

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.660
I don't really understand what you mean,

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.870
but don't scrub the stain so hard you tear a hole!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:02.910
Huh?

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.540
I don't think I'll be able to fool her for much longer.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.370
Oh honey, our little girl has grown so much.

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.370
I'll set them out to dry!

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:16.660
We have to be sure to have no regrets,
no matter how things turn out.

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:24.660
Yuko...

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:28.200
If you don't wash wool properly, then it will shrink.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.040
Huh?

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:34.870
Don't give up, Shamiko!
Learn how to do laundry through experience.

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:36.950
And don't misread what's on the tag!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.540
Monday

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.330
G'morning, Shami!

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:57.830
Huh?

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.450
Why the gym clothes? We don't have gym today.

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:03.580
My uniform became unusable.
I'll be wearing these for the time being.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:05.410
I have a spare uniform. Do you want to borrow it?

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:08.250
I have so many questions for you right now!
But thank you very much!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.870
Okay, I'm going to get changed right away!

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:13.330
Poof

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.950
Uh.... well...

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:19.040
I think...

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:22.200
...it makes you cute, like a fairy that lives in the forest.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.080
I don't need your awkward comments to back me up.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:25.830
I'm just fine.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.830
When my new uniform comes,
I'll wash this one and return it to you!

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.750
You don't have to, I always
send my laundry out to the cleaners.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.870
But if you insist on doing it yourself, then I'd like that.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:40.290
Smile

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:38.790
You seem like you'd be good at doing household chores,

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:40.450
so I have high expectations, Shamiko.

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:43.120
Smile
Uh.... sure...

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:52.410
Handwash
30 degrees Celsius
(85 degrees Fahrenheit)
Gently ring dry

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:48.160
This number means I should handwash by splashing it
in hot water that's over 85 degrees, right?

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.160
Splash, splash, splash...

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:49.950
Then I should leave it spin dry
for about 10 minutes, I guess?

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.250
Well, the longer it goes, the better chance
the stain has of coming out!

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.330
A reminder of yesterday's failure.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:58.250
You're really daring, Magical Girl!

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.750
I hope you don't come to regret those words!

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:01.540
Sure.

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:03.160
I'll make sure it's silky and soft!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:10.950
Handwash
Gently ring dry

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:07.160
Don't give up, Shamiko!
Laundry is all about knowledge and experience!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.040
Don't misread what's on the tag!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.910
I'll make sure it's silky and soft!

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.370
Take this, and take that!

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:20.160
I'm going to get you! Just wait! Take this!

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:25.160
Bam! BAM! Are you prepared to die?
If not, you better be!

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:26.620
She really has no...

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:30.120
Were you about to say something just now, Mom?

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:32.950
No, nothing at all. Please continue.

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:34.500
Am I doing all right?

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:39.870
As a mother, the one thing I must never do
is admit that my daughter has no talent!

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:41.540
Is that what you were trying to say?!

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:43.290
This doll is really adorable!

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:48.540
Hm, but... close-quarters combat against Momo
would put me at a disadvantage.

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:51.080
I thought it might be a good idea to find something
that I could throw at her...

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.040
You mean a projectile.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:52.660
Huh?

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:53.580
Ryo?

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:57.580
I think the best strategy is to rely on everything you can
aside from your physical strength, Sis.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:01.080
Bow & arrow, rifle, cannon, rocket.
There are a lot of options.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:03.250
But you should stick to what suits you.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:04.950
The modern era is all about projectile weapons.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.540
I think I'm getting the picture!

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:09.750
You're really smart, Ryo.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.200
Do your best, Sis.

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:15.160
The modern era is all about projectiles!

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:16.700
What's gotten into you?

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:20.290
You look cute in that, Shamiko.
Just like a kindergartener with a smock.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:21.410
I'm a high schooler.

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:24.000
Anyway, I've come to a very important revelation.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:28.370
If I even get close to Momo, she'll work her wiles
and trap me in some crazy situation again!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.370
Wassup?

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.330
The instant I let myself get sucked into her world,
then everything will be over!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:32.540
What are you doing?!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:35.160
The length of the uniform was bothering me,
so I thought I might shorten it.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.370
You realize I borrowed this from YOU, right?!

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.830
But I'm only going to shorten it a little bit.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:41.700
If you're going to wear it, you'd prefer that it fit, right?

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:42.830
Well...

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:44.080
Come on, take a seat.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:46.290
Sewing set
Convenient
to have on hand!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:49.540
Prick
Prick
Prick

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.250
Are you studying up on projectiles?

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:50.330
Th-that's none of your business, Momo!

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:50.910
It is.

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:54.290
I mean, I'm going to be your victim
after it's complete right?

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:56.160
I have the right to offer my opinion.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:14:00.830
Prick
Prick
Prick

00:13:56.790 --> 00:14:00.790
In fact, I'm certain that my input will be
what makes it into a really great weapon.

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:04.830
W-well... I'm not so sure.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:07.160
You want to make an awesome projectile, right?

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.790
Then come with me after school.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:09.660
Okay...

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.950
Great, then I'll fix the lining
at the bottom of the uniform later.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:12.790
Right.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:16.870
You just fall for her ploys each and every time.
It's really adorable, Shamiko.

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:17.580
Huh?!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.410
Shamiko... she got the better of you again today, huh?

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:23.330
Please stop making the assumption
that I'm destined to lose no matter what I do!

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:24.410
Prick

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:24.370
Owie!

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.620
I can't keep the needle from hitting you
if you move around so much.

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.040
Oh, sorry.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:38.660
Prick
Prick
Prick
Prick

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:32.200
You're really good at sewing.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:38.660
Yeah. Some damage that my Magical Girl outfit
takes lasts even after I cancel my transformation.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:42.000
It would be a waste to buy new clothes
every time they frayed a little,

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.500
Prick
Prick

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:44.410
It came
loose...
Prick
Prick

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:44.330
so I thought it was a good skill to develop.

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:47.950
Prick
Prick

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.200
That's a surprise to me.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.200
So, are you a really good chef, too?

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.250
People often told me that my cooking
could be used as a weapon.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.450
Wow, so it's one of those things
that can destroy a person's stomach, huh?

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:00.790
This is...

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.660
An abandoned factory I own.

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:03.660
You OWN?!

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:05.700
A while back, I kind of blew it up
and then ended up buying it.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:10.120
The mysteries surrounding Momo
only get deeper and deeper.

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:11.700
Um...

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:14.000
What's up with this strangely shaped wall?

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:14.910
That's a storehouse.

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:15.870
Storehouse?

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:16.910
It used to be, anyway.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.200
Let's start practicing how to use projectiles.

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.200
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:23.540
I'm going home!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.500
First of all, you have the wrong idea
about projectile attacks.

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:28.830
Things like rubber bands aren't going to help,
you have to summon your magic and project that out.

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:29.540
Magic?!

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:31.040
Let me go home, I wanna go home!

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:34.200
I'm going to keep this with me. It's dangerous.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:39.120
YOUR WEAPON WAS STOLEN!!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.540
I know I made it myself,

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:37.580
but there's absolutely no way
that rubber band is more dangerous

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.250
than whatever made that hole you showed me!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.450
Right...

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:43.950
You're not going home until you shoot something.

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:46.580
I can't do it, no way, it's impossible!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.700
There is no can or cannot, you just have to do it.

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:51.620
So let's do it.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.870
What are you even talking about?!

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:57.250
No matter what you unleash over here,
it won't cause any problems.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.750
So just let yourself go crazy.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:01.870
You've grown horns and a tail, which means...

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.830
...you have more than enough potential
to produce some magic.

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:07.120
No way. The only thing I can produce is eye juice!

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:10.580
Everyone's like that at first.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:12.700
Let's start by practicing form.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.330
You'll need a target.

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:16.450
Something the right size should do...

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:24.540
Perfect.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.250
You can't! The poor thing!

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:31.620
DEMON GOD STATUE
A wicked stone statue that harbors
the banished souls of the Dark Clan!
It's super sinister!
Looks like it might fall apart

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.580
Demon God Statue!

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:31.290
Lately it's been called the Ancestor Statue
or "Ancestue" for short.

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:33.620
JUST STOP IT

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:33.620
Don't use the poor thing as a target.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:36.120
I don't think you're focused enough yet.

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:38.000
Maybe you need a wand or something.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.290
But I'd hate to break off a tree branch over this.

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.250
Do you feel nothing for the poor statue?

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.040
There it is!

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:47.500
Whoa!

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.660
For now, will you use this wand?

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:53.120
I get the feeling something this amazing
is wasted on me!

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:56.750
It's fine, there's nothing else around here
that fits well enough.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:56.750
I'm a Demon Girl so stuff like this doesn't really suit me...

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:58.950
What about my rubber band gun?

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.450
That won't work. Use this.

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:01.790
Wah! I grabbed it without thinking!

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.410
It feels a little warm.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.910
Forget about all that and let's get to work.

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:15.950
Do you feel anything coming out?

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:18.370
I've got buckets of sweat coming out,
if that's what you mean.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:20.620
Oorah!

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:22.950
Oorah!

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:25.450
You might have better luck if you yell something out.

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:27.620
Do you have any strong feelings
about the world in general?

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:28.700
Huh?

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:33.160
Something like, "I want to crush everything!"
or "This world should be plunged into darkness!"

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:36.250
B-but I don't feel anything like that.

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:37.700
Everyone around here is really nice...

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:38.540
Is that so?

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:43.080
Well, then anything is fine.
Just shout whatever comes to mind.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.910
Um... well...

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:49.250
Tonight I want to have a big feast!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.200
That's not what I meant.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.250
S
H
O
C
K
!!

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:55.750
Sorry, I realize I shouldn't have said "anything."

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:59.080
The way that wand works is when the innate feelings
in your heart resound strongly with it,

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:02.450
you'll discover a keyword that
will unlock all of your magical power.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:04.000
In my case it was...

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:07.250
"Fresh Peach Heart Shower!"

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:08.540
Like that.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.450
"Fresh"...?

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:14.330
Huh? What did you say?

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:17.620
You don't have to memorize it. Just forget it.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:22.080
What? I wanna see it! Fresh Peach Heart Shower!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.660
Use this! Here! Show me, show me!

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:25.620
I don't want you to see it.

