She
did
it!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.750
Since you awakened your demonic power,

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.330
you should have one or two offensive attacks.

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:14.750
That's the whole reason I was watching over you,
to make sure you didn't lose control.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:16.450
Huh? You were watching over me?!

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:18.450
Don't let that distract you.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:22.500
For right now, just focus on turning your desires
into some sort of attack name.

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:25.790
Uh, um... then how about...

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.290
Applepeas!

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:30.290
Subray!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.450
Syneed!

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:34.250
Okay, I get that you want to go eat at a restaurant!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:35.200
Those didn't work? Then...

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:35.750
Panda Excess!

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.500
They do sound like attacks, but that's not what I meant!

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:39.830
You dummy! Are you even
taking this seriously, Shamiko?!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.620
I... I am...

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.200
Then you have to focus on getting stronger!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:47.580
You know, not every Magical Girl out there
is the cunning type like I am!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.330
Most of them show absolutely no mercy!

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:51.540
If you come across one like that,

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:53.870
they're going to boil you alive in an instant!

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:55.080
SOFTLY BOILED
SOFTLY BOILED
YUKO SOUP MIX
YUKO SOUP MIX
SEAWEED FLAVOR
SALT FLAVOR

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:55.080
Boiled alive?!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.620
By the way, did you just call me a dummy?!

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:00.870
I didn't call you that! Dummy!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:07.250
W-we only just met each other,
so why are being so supportive of me?

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.040
You seem oddly passionate about it, too.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.950
Don't get hung up on details like that.

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:14.160
It's only natural to get hung up on details like that!

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:16.750
Shamiko, the sun is gonna set soon.

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:20.040
N-now that you mention it, I'm pretty hungry.

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:23.910
If you manage to shoot something,
I'll make you a hamburg steak from 100% beef.

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:27.200
And I'll carefully simmer the demi-glace sauce
with a hint of red wine.

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:30.330
Delicious

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:30.080
Is there really such a thing as 100% beef in this world?!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:30.700
Obviously.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.410
Then what about 120%?!

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:33.540
Alright, let's get back to it!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:34.620
Roger that!

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:39.200
Before the sun sets, you should just focus on shouting
whatever phrases pop into your head.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:40.700
I want to go to Atami City!

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.120
I want to be covered in cats!

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:43.500
The wireless signal in my room is too weak!

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:44.660
Broccoli is delicious!

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:46.000
Natto, egg and rice!

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:47.120
Uh, um...

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:49.700
I hope that everyone will become friends!

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:53.500
Whoa!

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:56.790
Something came out!

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.540
It's moving super slow, but I shot something!

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:00.000
It's tiny and adorable!

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.540
Is that really all you've got?

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:05.580
Um? Is it just me, or is it headed my way now?

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:06.870
It's going straight towards you.

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:09.250
My master!
I think it lacks enough propulsion

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:13.540
My Master!!

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:11.910
and is trying to make its way back into your body.

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:14.120
What happens if it hits me?

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:16.290
I think it will probably hurt a little.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.410
About the same as an intramuscular injection?

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:23.120
That's one of those injections that hurts a lot, isn't it?

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:27.120
Here, I'm returning this.

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:27.870
Sure.

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:31.040
I'll make you regret this, Magical Girl!

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:34.540
It'll probably disappear if you can keep running
for between 20 and 30 minutes.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:36.500
You're going that way?

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:43.830
I guess I'll run with you.

00:21:43.830 --> 00:21:47.580
Why would you do that?!
You realize I'm not running because I want to!

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:52.910
"I hope that everyone will become friends"...
was that what you said?

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:58.410
I think I'm going to keep training you
for a while, Shamiko.

00:21:58.410 --> 00:21:59.620
Why would you do that?!

00:21:59.620 --> 00:22:00.500
Hey there!

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:03.250
Gah! It's starting to catch up!

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:06.000
I'm back!

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:08.080
Don't think this means you've- OWIE!

00:22:08.540 --> 00:22:11.080
Ugh... it hurts as bad as an intramuscular injection.

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:12.750
Okay, let's keep running to the next bridge.

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:15.830
Why? There's no reason for me
to keep running anymore...

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:19.870
Don't give up, Shamiko!
Even if you get pricked, don't stop running!

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:34.040
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:23:51.000 --> 00:24:06.000
Preview

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:54.290
I ended up running so much today, all because of Momo.

00:23:54.290 --> 00:23:55.580
You did good work out there.

00:23:55.580 --> 00:23:57.450
Anyway, this is the next episode preview.

00:23:57.450 --> 00:23:59.580
I suddenly find myself at a health spa,

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:01.250
and fall even deeper in debt to Momo.

00:24:01.250 --> 00:24:03.040
Shamiko, you're a real snowball when it comes to debt,

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:06.000
Sharpen Your Mind!! The Newly Awakened Powers of the Magical Girl

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:03.950
so I'll hook you up with a job.

00:24:03.950 --> 00:24:06.000
Anri, are you sure this job is gonna be okay?
